cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Mini Forests need evidence, not just enthusiasm: analysis code and data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and data for a Nature Cities Perspective on Mini Forests
  (Miyawaki-method plantings): a media-coverage corpus of 5,075 English-language
  news articles (2015-2025), an evidence synthesis of 108 Mini Forest studies, and
  a municipal cost comparison for Northeast U.S. municipalities.
type: dataset
